{"ID":"20240118151122-mxw6ubv","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151122-mxw6ubv","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151122-mxw6ubv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151122-j93jzso\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240201134419-biv4oyb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240201134419-biv4oyb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"203假苏（荆芥）","type":"doc","updated":"20240201134419"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151122-j93jzso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151122-j93jzso","updated":"20240122132233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，温，无毒。治寒热，鼠，瘰疬生疮，破结聚气，下瘀血，除湿痹。生川泽。一名鼠蓂。又名荆芥。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132237-i93x41u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132237-i93x41u"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】多生野地，处处有之，气味芳香，茎与叶皆入药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132239-bsz6a8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132239-bsz6a8z"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛，性温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132240-c10r7pn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132240-c10r7pn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】荆芥为发表要药，功能祛风理血，发汗退热。主治寒热头疼诸风疮毒。亦为妇人胎前产后良剂。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132241-v82v92e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132241-v82v92e"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【藏器】去邪除劳渴，冷风出汗，煮汁服之，捣烂醋和，敷疔肿毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132243-m62jzsg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132243-m62jzsg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】单用治恶风贼风，口面歪斜，遍身瘰痹，心虚忘事，益力添精，辟邪毒气，通利血脉，传送五脏不足气，助脾胃。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132245-3lizg4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132245-3lizg4g"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【志良】主血劳，风气壅满，背脊疼痛，虚汗，理丈夫脚气，筋骨烦痛，及阴阳毒，伤寒头痛，头旋目眩，手足筋急。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132247-29nskmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132247-29nskmi"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】利五脏，消食下气醒酒，作菜生熟皆可食，并煎茶饮之，以豉汁煎服，治暴伤寒能发汗。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132250-9nou6w5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132250-9nou6w5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏颂】治妇人血风，及疮疥为要药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132252-xraa0oe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132252-xraa0oe"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通八分至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132253-tn9tgq1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132253-tn9tgq1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】凡表虚有汗，血虚寒热，阴虚火炎面赤，因而头痛者均忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132253-9fr8l18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132253-9fr8l18"}},{"ID":"20240122132253-v0ca4tc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132253-v0ca4tc"}},{"ID":"20240122132254-qaflu6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132254-qaflu6f","updated":"20240201134138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"203，诸位看这个。本草经上面，写的是，假苏。原名是假苏，现在我们称为荆芥。那这个药呢，味道是辛辣，性温。味辛性温的药。那是发表的药。你如果说，走个地方，哎呀，老师，他这个麻黄也没有卖，桂枝也没有，那我们用什么办法发表？就要荆芥。"}]},{"ID":"20240122132305-gvckxm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132305-gvckxm9","updated":"20240201134417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荆芥可以发表。功能祛风理血，发汗退热。一般过去呢，除了内服以外，新鲜的荆芥，你把它捣烂，跟醋和在一起，涂在外伤的创口，脓疡，脓疮的创口，都可以。消毒，都可以。所以中药很好用，外敷，内服都可以。就象你说老师，我找不到这个假苏，看不到荆芥，哎，那边有菊花，菊花叶可不可以？当然可以啊，菊花叶你把它拿来，把它弄成生汁，外敷通通可以。所以我们有非常多的药可以使用。那这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"皮肤痒，皮肤病，疥癣，我们都可以使用，荆芥"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。一般来说，我前面跟诸位讲过，皮肤上有化脓的时候，不要用发表的药。没有化脓，一些疥疮啊，身上一些痒啊，都可以使用。所以诸位看这个，你看，这个【苏颂】，治妇人血风，及疥疮都可以使用荆芥。那一般来说，我们要知道这个药是发表的药，所以病人已经在盗汗，已经在虚汗的时候你不要再用发表的药再去给他。因为加重他发表，就是流汗的这个速度。"}]},{"ID":"20240201134419-biv4oyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240201134419-biv4oyb"}}]}